cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this framework or its published results, please cite it as below."
title: "agent-evals: any coding-agent harness, any model, measured the same way on SWE-bench Verified"
type: software
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-12"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/psdhali/agent-evals"
url: "https://evals.preetdhaliwal.dev"
authors:
  - family-names: Dhaliwal
    given-names: Preetinder
abstract: >-
  An evaluation framework that runs any coding-agent harness with any model on SWE-bench
  Verified at scale, enforces hard cost limits per problem from outside the agent, grades with
  the official SWE-bench harness inside the official per-instance images, meters every inference
  call, judges every trajectory with an evidence-required LLM judge, and publishes each result
  with the provenance to reproduce it. Validated end to end from an empty AWS account using the
  repository's setup guide alone.
keywords:
  - SWE-bench
  - coding agents
  - evaluation
  - LLM judge
  - reproducibility
